# Every hidden file and directory under docs/, at any depth, is local-only.
#
# A standing rule rather than a list of exceptions, so a local input file or an
# exported asset dump needs no edit here to stay out of the repository. Two live
# uses today: `.env.participants`, the showcase invite list, which is real
# personal data (root CLAUDE.md keeps that out of this repo absolutely); and
# `.figma/`, full-resolution frame exports that are large, regenerable, and owned
# by the design file rather than by git.
#
# The negation is load-bearing: `.*` matches this file too, and without the
# exception it could never be added in the first place.
.*
!.gitignore
